      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>No.&nbsp; If you need to draw a card, if you need to discard a card from the deck, or if you need to play a card from the deck, then you shuffle that deck&#39;s trash back into the deck and continue.</p><p>For some reason that line was left out of the EE rulebook.</p>",
