    {
      "id": 65565,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-10T19:17:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There are only 3 conditions where you automatically reshuffle your trash to make a new deck.</p><p>1) When you need to \"Draw\" and there are no cards to draw</p><p>2) When you need to \"discard\" from the top of the deck but no cards to discard</p><p>3) When you need to \"play\" the top card of the deck but have no cards</p><p>Any other time, you are left without a deck. This includes any time you would \"reveal\" cards from the top of a deck. If you are told to reveal cards and there are no more cards, then the action ends&nbsp;<em>without</em> a reshuffle.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:43:01.944Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 8184,
      "topic_slug": "decked",
      "display_username": "Foote",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
