      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>There are only 3 conditions where you automatically reshuffle your trash to make a new deck.</p><p>1) When you need to &quot;Draw&quot; and there are no cards to draw</p><p>2) When you need to &quot;discard&quot; from the top of the deck but no cards to discard</p><p>3) When you need to &quot;play&quot; the top card of the deck but have no cards</p><p>Any other time, you are left without a deck. This includes any time you would &quot;reveal&quot; cards from the top of a deck. If you are told to reveal cards and there are no more cards, then the action ends&nbsp;<em>without</em> a reshuffle.</p>",
